{"id":"6c4d7648de3418cf","group":"92","path":"92/92-lem-godel-number-recursive.md","title":"Gödel Numbering Recursive","display":"lem-godel-number-recursive — Gödel Numbering Recursive","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-lem-godel-number-recursive","aliases":["92-lem-godel-number-recursive"],"display":"lem-godel-number-recursive — Gödel Numbering Recursive","depends_on":["[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-recursive-function]]","[[92-df-recursive-set]]","[[92-df-expression]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-arithmetization-steps]]","[[92-df-encoding-completeness]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-lem-godel-number-recursive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-lem-godel-number-recursive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-godel-number-recursive — Gödel Numbering Recursive"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d4d93aba49d678d8\" href=\"?note=d4d93aba49d678d8\" title=\"92-df-recursive-set\">92-df-recursive-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c56ec2b54fc34fc6\" href=\"?note=c56ec2b54fc34fc6\" title=\"92-df-expression\">92-df-expression</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"573d6ccf155d773c\" href=\"?note=573d6ccf155d773c\" title=\"92-df-arithmetization-steps\">92-df-arithmetization-steps</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bb4321f7cd8a5eb1\" href=\"?note=bb4321f7cd8a5eb1\" title=\"92-df-encoding-completeness\">92-df-encoding-completeness</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner \\cdot \\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner \\cdot \\urcorner\\)</span> (Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Code}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Code}_G\\)</span> (Gödel-code image constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)\\)</span> (expression set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"c56ec2b54fc34fc6\" href=\"?note=c56ec2b54fc34fc6\" title=\"92-df-expression\">92-df-expression</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_G\">\\(\\Sigma_G\\)</span> (signature, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(C_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (valid expression-code set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"bb4321f7cd8a5eb1\" href=\"?note=bb4321f7cd8a5eb1\" title=\"92-df-encoding-completeness\">92-df-encoding-completeness</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{entry}_G:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathrm{entry}_G:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (total component decoder)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{len}\">\\(\\operatorname{len}\\)</span> (finite-sequence length)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> (the explicit symbol code from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SeqCode},\\mathrm{SeqDec}\">\\(\\mathrm{SeqCode},\\mathrm{SeqDec}\\)</span> (finite-sequence codec, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"573d6ccf155d773c\" href=\"?note=573d6ccf155d773c\" title=\"92-df-arithmetization-steps\">92-df-arithmetization-steps</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecSet},\\mathrm{Rec}\">\\(\\mathrm{RecSet},\\mathrm{Rec}\\)</span> (recursive-set/function predicates)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}godel\\text{-}number\\text{-}recursive}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nC_G&amp;=\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G))=\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{SeqCode}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{entry}_G(n,i)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n(\\mathrm{SeqDec}(n))_i,&amp;n\\in C_G\\land i&lt;\\operatorname{len}(\\mathrm{SeqDec}(n)),\\\\\n0,&amp;\\text{otherwise},\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{RecSet}(C_G)\\land\\mathrm{Rec}(\\mathrm{entry}_G).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}godel\\text{-}number\\text{-}recursive}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nC_G&amp;=\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G))=\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{SeqCode}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{entry}_G(n,i)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n(\\mathrm{SeqDec}(n))_i,&amp;n\\in C_G\\land i&lt;\\operatorname{len}(\\mathrm{SeqDec}(n)),\\\\\n0,&amp;\\text{otherwise},\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{RecSet}(C_G)\\land\\mathrm{Rec}(\\mathrm{entry}_G).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner E \\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner E \\urcorner\\)</span> : 表达式<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span>的Gödel数</li>\n<li>语法编码映射的定义域不是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N^k\">\\(\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>，所以不能把<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span>本身直接写成<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span>的元素</li>\n<li>正确的数值化结论是：合法码集可判定，且码的符号分量可由全递归函数解出</li>\n<li>编码方法（例如）：\n<ul>\n<li>为每个符号分配固定编码</li>\n<li>序列编码使用幂次和素数分解</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>可计算性确保算术化的有效性</li>\n<li>这是自引用的技术基础</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-set","status":"resolved","id":"d4d93aba49d678d8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-expression","status":"resolved","id":"c56ec2b54fc34fc6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-expression]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetization-steps","status":"resolved","id":"573d6ccf155d773c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetization-steps]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-encoding-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"bb4321f7cd8a5eb1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-encoding-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\ulcorner \\cdot \\urcorner$ (Gödel numbering, see [[92-df-godel-numbering]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Code}_G$ (Gödel-code image constructor, see [[92-df-godel-numbering]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-expression","status":"resolved","id":"c56ec2b54fc34fc6","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)$ (expression set, see [[92-df-expression]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma_G$ (signature, see [[92-df-signature]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-encoding-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"bb4321f7cd8a5eb1","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$C_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ (valid expression-code set, see [[92-df-encoding-completeness]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$c$ (the explicit symbol code from [[92-df-godel-numbering]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetization-steps","status":"resolved","id":"573d6ccf155d773c","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SeqCode},\\mathrm{SeqDec}$ (finite-sequence codec, see [[92-df-arithmetization-steps]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\ulcorner \\cdot \\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Code}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_G","display":false},{"tex":"C_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{entry}_G:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{len}","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SeqCode},\\mathrm{SeqDec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecSet},\\mathrm{Rec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}godel\\text{-}number\\text{-}recursive}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nC_G&=\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G))=\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{SeqCode}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{entry}_G(n,i)&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n(\\mathrm{SeqDec}(n))_i,&n\\in C_G\\land i<\\operatorname{len}(\\mathrm{SeqDec}(n)),\\\\\n0,&\\text{otherwise},\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n&\\mathrm{RecSet}(C_G)\\land\\mathrm{Rec}(\\mathrm{entry}_G).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\ulcorner E \\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}","display":false}],"bytes":2190,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","d65795dc15ebce4b","d4d93aba49d678d8","c56ec2b54fc34fc6","d666a3e3ee6c8148","573d6ccf155d773c","bb4321f7cd8a5eb1"]}